DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
5897::$$$message_0041_0000_0000$$$::...It should be about that time.[lr]::
5898::$$$message_0041_0000_0001$$$::I have a truly unusual guest coming over today.[lr]::
5899::$$$message_0041_0000_0002$$$::Oh, she's here.[lr]::
5900::$$$message_0041_0000_0003$$$::I get up and go to the front door.::
5901::$$$message_0041_0001_0000$$$::"Welcome..."[lr]::
5902::$$$message_0041_0001_0001$$$::...Hm? Nobody's here?[lr]::
5903::$$$message_0041_0001_0002$$$::"...There really isn't anyone here. Am I getting pranked?::
5904::$$$message_0041_0002_0000$$$::"Goodness, not even Fuji-nee plays ding-dong ditch these days, much less elementary school kids. [cacheimage storage=キャスター私服01e(近)][wvl][playstop time=200 nowait=1][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=53 top=10 time=200 accel=2 storage=キャスター私服01e(近)][shock vmax=40 time=400 count=4][wm canskip=0][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=250 top=10 time=5000 accel=0 storage=キャスター私服01e(近)]Wuhh!?"[lr]::
5905::$$$message_0041_0002_0001$$$::Caster's shoes are already in the entranceway. How did she get in?::
5906::$$$message_0041_0003_0000$$$::"Oi..."[lr]::
5907::$$$message_0041_0003_0001$$$::"Good day to you, boy. I took the liberty of deactivating your detection Bounded Field."[lr]::
5908::$$$message_0041_0003_0002$$$::"..."::
5909::$$$message_0041_0004_0000$$$::She looks at the shoes pensively, seemingly uninterested in me.[lr]::
5910::$$$message_0041_0004_0001$$$::Is she worried that the heels aren't lined up?::
5911::$$$message_0041_0005_0000$$$::"By the way, is Sakura in?"[lr]::
5912::$$$message_0041_0005_0001$$$::"Oh, is that what this is about?"[lr]::
5913::$$$message_0041_0005_0002$$$::From Caster's point of view, this was originally the enemy's home. Things are tense between her and Tohsaka and Saber.[lr]::
5914::$$$message_0041_0005_0003$$$::She's checking whether Sakura might be here to potentially take her side.::
5915::$$$message_0041_0006_0000$$$::"No, she's out shopping in Shinto today. She said she won't be back until tonight."[lr]::
5916::$$$message_0041_0006_0001$$$::"That's a relief."[lr]::
5917::$$$message_0041_0006_0002$$$::"Yeah, if you'd told me ahead of time, I could've stopped... [wvl canskip=0 time=400]What?"[lr]::
5918::$$$message_0041_0006_0003$$$::"I want to avoid her seeing me here."::
5919::$$$message_0041_0007_0000$$$::"You know, that girl believes I'm the perfect wife. If she knew that I was going to you for help..."[lr]::
5920::$$$message_0041_0007_0001$$$::"I get it. You don't want to shatter her dreams.[lr]::
5921::$$$message_0041_0007_0002$$$::I recall the incident when we were out shopping. Sakura would be disappointed if she knew.::
5922::$$$message_0041_0008_0000$$$::"Gods forbid. I just don't want to embarrass myself."[lr]::
5923::$$$message_0041_0008_0001$$$::"...Okay, I'll remember that.[lr]::
5924::$$$message_0041_0008_0002$$$::I'll keep this visit a secret from Sakura, and I'll chase everyone else off, so you can relax."::
5925::$$$message_0041_0009_0000$$$::"Then once again, good day.[lr]::
5926::$$$message_0041_0009_0001$$$::No, I suppose I should call you my master or teacher today."::
5927::$$$message_0041_0010_0000$$$::"Not that one. A lot of them are spongy on the inside, so bigger isn't necessarily better."[lr]::
5928::$$$message_0041_0010_0001$$$::I am teaching this master of magecraft how to pick potatoes at the market.[lr]::
5929::$$$message_0041_0010_0002$$$::It's funny where life takes you.::
5930::$$$message_0041_0011_0000$$$::"R-really? Yes, I knew that. It's completely elementary."[lr]::
5931::$$$message_0041_0011_0001$$$::Caster gives me her signature seductive chuckle.[lr]::
5932::$$$message_0041_0011_0002$$$::But it lacks any of its usual vigor.::
5933::$$$message_0041_0012_0000$$$::"Let's go with nikujaga[line len=2]meat and potato stew. It's a relatively Japanese recipe."[lr]::
5934::$$$message_0041_0012_0001$$$::And so...[lr]::
5935::$$$message_0041_0012_0002$$$::Caster's here to take cooking lessons from me, based on our earlier agreement.::
5936::$$$message_0041_0013_0000$$$::"...[humming]"[lr]::
5937::$$$message_0041_0013_0001$$$::The sight of this eye-catching beauty draped in a colorful costume, standing in a quaint Japanese kitchen, feels way out of place.::
5938::$$$message_0041_0014_0000$$$::"Do you think Souichirou would like this stew...?"[lr]::
5939::$$$message_0041_0014_0001$$$::"How am I supposed to know that?"[lr]::
5940::$$$message_0041_0014_0002$$$::"You're the one who said that single men enjoy homemade meat and potato stew."::
5941::$$$message_0041_0015_0000$$$::"I don't know if that applies to everyone. It's more like a shared fantasy, or a self-serving male dream.[lr]::
5942::$$$message_0041_0015_0001$$$::Before you worry about that, roll up your sleeves first."::
5943::$$$message_0041_0016_0000$$$::"Huh? O-oh, silly me. [cacheimage storage=キャスターローブ無し01c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg time=400 storage=キャスターローブ無し01c(中) textoff=0]Yes, I knew that. Really.[lr]::
5944::$$$message_0041_0016_0001$$$::Don't worry, I just need to cast wards of water, soil, and grease resistance on it. That'll make it completely antiseptic!"::
5945::$$$message_0041_0017_0000$$$::"...Sure, okay."[lr]::
5946::$$$message_0041_0017_0001$$$::Are we really going to be okay, though?[lr]::
5947::$$$message_0041_0017_0002$$$::Once we get back on track and I teach Caster how to remove the potato shoots, she uses the kitchen knife with surprising dexterity.::
5948::$$$message_0041_0018_0000$$$::"Oh, you're used to knives, huh?"[lr]::
5949::$$$message_0041_0018_0001$$$::"Whatever do you mean?"[lr]::
5950::$$$message_0041_0018_0002$$$::"The way you use that kitchen knife. It doesn't make you seem like a novice."[lr]::
5951::$$$message_0041_0018_0003$$$::When I first started teaching Sakura, she was so nervous I couldn't take my eyes off her. In contrast, Caster's knifework is confident and relaxed.::
5952::$$$message_0041_0019_0000$$$::"It's only natural that I'd be accustomed to using bladed implements in magical rituals."[lr]::
5953::$$$message_0041_0019_0001$$$::"Speaking of that, I saw that you made a ship in a bottle."[lr]::
5954::$$$message_0041_0019_0002$$$::Which means she must be quite good with her hands... How did she end up cooking [font italic=true]that[font italic=false], then?::
5955::$$$message_0041_0020_0000$$$::"It's good to be relaxed. Just act like you're brewing one of your usual elixirs."[lr]::
5956::$$$message_0041_0020_0001$$$::"Cooking is nothing like compounding.[lr]::
5957::$$$message_0041_0020_0002$$$::Pharmaceutics prioritizes efficacy, while cooking must balance flavor and nutrition. They're like the fifth dimension."::
5958::$$$message_0041_0021_0000$$$::"Really? You still need to follow a recipe. I thought it would be easy for you."[lr]::
5959::$$$message_0041_0021_0001$$$::"I wouldn't be taking lessons from you if that were the case.[lr]::
5960::$$$message_0041_0021_0002$$$::...Sakura also said that food is a love language.[lr]::
5961::$$$message_0041_0021_0003$$$::Half of the goal is the cook's feelings for the person eating the food. It is different from the compounding that happens while focusing your thoughts and performing calculations during a complex ritual."[lr]::
5962::$$$message_0041_0021_0004$$$::"Oof... Is that so?"::
5963::$$$message_0041_0022_0000$$$::I cook every day, so I have never thought of it like that.[lr]::
5964::$$$message_0041_0022_0001$$$::It's the mindset of a village elder who worries that a hungry tiger might come down to menace the village.[lr]::
5965::$$$message_0041_0022_0002$$$::...I wonder if I've been missing out on something important in life.::
5966::$$$message_0041_0023_0000$$$::"Yes. That is why I would not be happy even if I cooked something delicious using an approach that seeks only results, like magecraft, and it made Souichirou happy."[lr]::
5967::$$$message_0041_0023_0001$$$::"...Huh."::
5968::$$$message_0041_0024_0000$$$::"There's no point if only I enjoy the cooking.[lr]::
5969::$$$message_0041_0024_0001$$$::I need to get better for both of us."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=300][lr]::
5970::$$$message_0041_0024_0002$$$::[seloop storage=se244.wav]I nod, impressed.[lr]::
5971::$$$message_0041_0024_0003$$$::The enthusiastic rhythm of a knife on cutting board doesn't sound like it would come from a tragic, fickle witch at all.::
5972::$$$message_0041_0025_0000$$$::"Excuse me, Shirou, do you have any [cacheimage storage=キャスターローブ無し01a(中)][wvl][playstop time=300 nowait=1][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 time=400 pos=l accel=-2 storage=キャスターローブ無し01a(中)][sestop time=300 nowait=true][wm canskip=0][cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01c(中),キャスターローブ無し02e(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=セイバー私服01c(中),キャスターローブ無し02e(中)]snacks[line len=2]"[lr]::
5973::$$$message_0041_0025_0001$$$::"...!"[lr]::
5974::$$$message_0041_0025_0002$$$::Caster freezes.[lr]::
5975::$$$message_0041_0025_0003$$$::It's already too late. Saber and Caster make eye contact.::
5976::$$$message_0041_0026_0000$$$::"Oh, it's you."[lr]::
5977::$$$message_0041_0026_0001$$$::"Caster... What are you doing here? [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服13a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー私服13a(中)]Shirou!?"[lr]::
5978::$$$message_0041_0026_0002$$$::"Wait. Caster isn't our enemy today. She's just here to learn how to cook."[lr]::
5979::$$$message_0041_0026_0003$$$::"That's right. Sorry to intrude, Saber."::
5980::$$$message_0041_0027_0000$$$::"How could you just agree... It's obviously all a pretext! [l][say storage=emi0441_sav_0021 name=セイバー][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服08a(中) textoff=0]Are you under her mind control, Shirou!?"[wvs][clfg storage=キャスターローブ無し01e(中) time=400 textoff=0][lr]::
5981::$$$message_0041_0027_0001$$$::"Of course not. Also, would you mind not telling Sakura and the others about this?"[lr]::
5982::$$$message_0041_0027_0002$$$::"Heh. You've shown your cards too early, Caster. This proves that you're up to no good!"[lr]::
5983::$$$message_0041_0027_0003$$$::Oh nooo! So this is what it means to feel utterly helpless!::
5984::$$$message_0041_0028_0000$$$::"Caster cannot be trusted. [l][say storage=emi0441_sav_0041 name=セイバー]Shirou, have you already forgotten what I[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服01c(中) textoff=0] endured in her captivity..."[lr]::
5985::$$$message_0041_0028_0001$$$::"Well, even if something that awful happened... Hey, what's wrong?"[lr]::
5986::$$$message_0041_0028_0002$$$::Saber's words trail off, and she's staring hotly at something behind me.[lr]::
5987::$$$message_0041_0028_0003$$$::I turn around and see that she's looking at the 200-gram pack of thinly sliced beef in Caster's hands.::
5988::$$$message_0041_0029_0000$$$::"Ahem... What are you making?"[lr]::
5989::$$$message_0041_0029_0001$$$::"I was teaching her to make meat and potato stew."[lr]::
5990::$$$message_0041_0029_0002$$$::"Meat and potato stew..."[lr]::
5991::$$$message_0041_0029_0003$$$::Saber mutters the words several times to herself.::
5992::$$$message_0041_0030_0000$$$::"It seems you have quite a sophisticated palate, thanks to the boy.[lr]::
5993::$$$message_0041_0030_0001$$$::I'm sure that if I can satisfy your palate, then Souichirou will find it palatable as well."[lr]::
5994::$$$message_0041_0030_0002$$$::Saber's expression completely changes, as if Caster just spoke an incantation.[lr]::
5995::$$$message_0041_0030_0003$$$::I'd expect no less from such a cunning mage.::
5996::$$$message_0041_0031_0000$$$::"Caster, it seems that we are not enemies today."[lr]::
5997::$$$message_0041_0031_0001$$$::"Yes. Meat and potato stew is a cheap price to pay for your alliance."[lr]::
5998::$$$message_0041_0031_0002$$$::That was [font italic=true]way[font italic=false] too easy, if you ask me.::
5999::$$$message_0041_0032_0000$$$::"...Very well.[lr]::
6000::$$$message_0041_0032_0001$$$::Leave the frontline combat to me. I will make sure you mages are free to perform your culinary work.[lr]::
6001::$$$message_0041_0032_0002$$$::I will endeavor to make sure no rapscallions discover your stew. I swear to defend it to the death."[lr]::
6002::$$$message_0041_0032_0003$$$::Um, it's not the stew I want to hide, but the fact that Caster is here.::
6003::$$$message_0041_0033_0000$$$::"...I guess it's the same, either way.[lr]::
6004::$$$message_0041_0033_0001$$$::We're counting on you, Saber. Take this for now."[lr]::
6005::$$$message_0041_0033_0002$$$::I hand her some mamemochi[line len=2]sticky rice cakes with beans in them[line len=2]from the cupboard.::
6006::$$$message_0041_0034_0000$$$::"Thanks, Caster. She's stubborn."[lr]::
6007::$$$message_0041_0034_0001$$$::"Saber is being reasonable. You're the strange one here, boy.[lr]::
6008::$$$message_0041_0034_0002$$$::It's hard to believe you're being this sincere with me after our previous history."::
6009::$$$message_0041_0035_0000$$$::"Mrgh. If you want to go there, Rider lives with us, too."[lr]::
6010::$$$message_0041_0035_0001$$$::"Heh. So she does. She's tried to kill you quite a few times."[lr]::
6011::$$$message_0041_0035_0002$$$::Caster snickers.[lr]::
6012::$$$message_0041_0035_0003$$$::I'm not quite sure if it's mirth or resentment I hear.::
6013::$$$message_0041_0036_0000$$$::"Look, it's all in the past now.[lr]::
6014::$$$message_0041_0036_0001$$$::Lancer said it too; there's no reason to hate someone just because you're enemies. And we aren't even enemies right now, so we can relax the way we think."::
6015::$$$message_0041_0037_0000$$$::"...You could say that.[lr]::
6016::$$$message_0041_0037_0001$$$::For example, you can't tell Sakura what I did to you."::
6017::$$$message_0041_0038_0000$$$::"It's all right. You're only here learning from me because you're able to switch your mindset."[lr]::
6018::$$$message_0041_0038_0001$$$::"...Not quite. I came because Souichirou suggested it.[lr]::
6019::$$$message_0041_0038_0002$$$::I would even study under Berserker if it was for Souichirou."[lr]::
6020::$$$message_0041_0038_0003$$$::...Hearing how easily she admits it makes me blush, instead.::
6021::$$$message_0041_0039_0000$$$::"You're really serious when it comes to Mr. Kuzuki."[lr]::
6022::$$$message_0041_0039_0001$$$::"Sakura's the same way, you know."[lr]::
6023::$$$message_0041_0039_0002$$$::"Mrgh. What's that supposed to mean?"::
6024::$$$message_0041_0040_0000$$$::"Oh, poor Sakura... Besides, it's not as if I dislike cooking.[cacheimage storage=キャスターローブ無し02c(中)][wvs][chgfg time=200 storage=キャスターローブ無し02c(中) textoff=0][lr]::
6025::$$$message_0041_0040_0001$$$::I'm willing to lie in order to live with the person I love. But cooking I can be pure and genuine about.::
6026::$$$message_0041_0041_0000$$$::Caster gently seasons the food, as if to dissolve her own emotions in it.[lr]::
6027::$$$message_0041_0041_0001$$$::It's pleasant watching her serene expression.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][stopdash]::
6028::$$$message_0041_0042_0000$$$::"...I wish I could let Sakura see this."[lr]::
6029::$$$message_0041_0042_0001$$$::"What are you saying? We're supposed to keep this a secret from[wvl][playstop time=2000 nowait=1][se storage=se396.wav]...............!"::
6030::$$$message_0041_0043_0000$$$::"Shirou!"[lr]::
6031::$$$message_0041_0043_0001$$$::"Oh, it's just you, Saber."[lr]::
6032::$$$message_0041_0043_0002$$$::"Phew, don't scare us like that."[lr]::
6033::$$$message_0041_0043_0003$$$::"Shirou, [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服08a(近),キャスターローブ無し03b(中),i衛宮邸台所(FD)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][clfg][delay speed=160][dash textoff=0 page=back mx=-746 opacity=200 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=759 imag=1.2 time=4000 cy=16 mag=1.2 my=0 storage=i衛宮邸台所(FD) rot=-0.0 accel=0][fg left=-158 index=2000 top=115 storage=セイバー私服08a(近)][fg left=360 index=1000 top=97 storage=キャスターローブ無し03b(中)][movefg textoff=0 page=back opacity=255 left=0 top=115 time=4000 accel=0 storage=セイバー私服08a(近)][movefg textoff=0 page=back opacity=255 left=400 top=97 time=4000 accel=0 storage=キャスターローブ無し03b(中)][fadein textoff=0 time=300 storage=i衛宮邸台所(FD) noclear=1][wvl]Rin has returned."[delay speed=user]::
6034::$$$message_0041_0044_0000$$$::"Tohsaka...!?"[lr]::
6035::$$$message_0041_0044_0001$$$::"That savage, monkey-like girl?[lr]::
6036::$$$message_0041_0044_0002$$$::...This isn't good. [cacheimage storage=キャスターローブ無し01d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=400 storage=キャスターローブ無し01d(中) textoff=0]I have the most trouble dealing with brutes like that girl or Berserker. I doubt we'll be able to resolve this through peaceful dialogue like we did with Saber."[lr]::
6037::$$$message_0041_0044_0003$$$::"Yes, she's a difficult opponent."::
6038::$$$message_0041_0045_0000$$$::...Yet another surprise from Caster.[lr]::
6039::$$$message_0041_0045_0001$$$::She apparently considers Rin an even more unreasonable opponent than Saber.::
6040::$$$message_0041_0046_0000$$$::"Well, she is hard to please, but..."[lr]::
6041::$$$message_0041_0046_0001$$$::"It isn't about being easy or hard to please.[l][say storage=emi0441_cas_0321 name=キャスター] I'll have you know, she's the first person to ever attempt to fistfight me in a duel between mages."[lr]::
6042::$$$message_0041_0046_0002$$$::"Yes, such mages never existed in the past. They are a modern development."::
6043::$$$message_0041_0047_0000$$$::"Ha...haha."[lr]::
6044::$$$message_0041_0047_0001$$$::Oh...I can't back her up on this one. Her bare-knuckled strategy bothered me that time, too.[lr]::
6045::$$$message_0041_0047_0002$$$::Wait, now's not the time for that.[lr]::
6046::$$$message_0041_0047_0003$$$::Tohsaka's footsteps are gradually getting closer.::
6047::$$$message_0041_0048_0000$$$::"Caster, do you have any convenient spells you can use to conceal us or teleport us away?"[lr]::
6048::$$$message_0041_0048_0001$$$::"No. Using magecraft now would be akin to setting off a smoke bomb."[lr]::
6049::$$$message_0041_0048_0002$$$::Damn it, she's close...::
6050::$$$message_0041_0049_0000$$$::"Here she comes!"[lr]::
6051::$$$message_0041_0049_0001$$$::"...Fuh!"::
6052::$$$message_0041_0050_0000$$$::"Hey, Emiya...[cacheimage storage=凛私服03d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服03d(中) textoff=0]Hm?"[lr]::
6053::$$$message_0041_0050_0001$$$::"H-[wvl][shock vmax=25 time=400 count=-3]hey there. Welcome home, Tohsaka."[lr]::
6054::$$$message_0041_0050_0002$$$::"What are [font italic=true]you[font italic=false] doing there?"[lr]::
6055::$$$message_0041_0050_0003$$$::Upon entering the living room, Tohsaka frowns.::
6056::$$$message_0041_0051_0000$$$::Figures. Saber standing there stirring the pot with sweat running down her forehead is just too strange a sight.::
6057::$$$message_0041_0052_0000$$$::"Hell must have frozen over if Saber's cooking. Are you getting ready for dinner?"[lr]::
6058::$$$message_0041_0052_0001$$$::"Yeah, I was teaching her to cook. Meat and potato stew is pretty versatile, right?"::
6059::$$$message_0041_0053_0000$$$::"Hmm...? [cacheimage storage=凛私服06c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服06c(中) textoff=0][se storage=se683.wav][move textoff=0 time=120 path=(-22,72,255)(23,72,255)(-22,72,255)(26,72,255)(26,72,255)(26,72,255)(-25,72,255)(22,72,255)(-23,72,255)(-23,72,255)(27,72,255)(-22,72,255)(-22,72,255)(-22,72,255)(-16,110,255)(-8,72,255)(-5,108,255)(-1,72,255) storage=セイバー私服_鍋持ち開09a(中) accel=0]Hold on, Saber. You're not stir-frying right now.[lr]::
6060::$$$message_0041_0053_0001$$$::Saber makes a show of whipping the stew around with her ladle[line len=2]it brings to mind her country's less-than-stellar culinary character.::
6061::$$$message_0041_0054_0000$$$::"So as you can see, we're a little busy right now. If you need something, we can talk later."[lr]::
6062::$$$message_0041_0054_0001$$$::"Okay. ...By the way, what's this thing wrapped in purple cloth over here? Garbage?"::
6063::$$$message_0041_0055_0000$$$::...Caster's turned her robe inside-out and is using it to hide herself, if you can call it that.[lr]::
6064::$$$message_0041_0055_0001$$$::Tohsaka pokes the purple Caster wrap with her foot.[se storage=se042.wav][lr]::
6065::$$$message_0041_0055_0002$$$::Caster doesn't so much as twitch. A ninja couldn't have done it better.::
6066::$$$message_0041_0056_0000$$$::"A-[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]actually, let's hear what you had to say![lr]::
6067::$$$message_0041_0056_0001$$$::I'll do anything you ask. You can even treat me like garbage!"[lr]::
6068::$$$message_0041_0056_0002$$$::"What's all this about garbage? I just wanted to borrow Saber for a while, but it doesn't look like I can."::
6069::$$$message_0041_0057_0000$$$::"Yes, I cannot step away from my station. I am duty-bound to guard this post."[lr]::
6070::$$$message_0041_0057_0001$$$::"And here I was going to ask you to taste test some souvenirs."::
6071::$$$message_0041_0058_0000$$$::"Well, Shirou, good luck with the stew."[lr]::
6072::$$$message_0041_0058_0001$$$::"Talk about a fast change of heart!"::
6073::$$$message_0041_0059_0000$$$::Saber and I trade a wordless glance.[lr]::
6074::$$$message_0041_0059_0001$$$::   I will keep Rin away from here, for the time being.[lr]::
6075::$$$message_0041_0059_0002$$$::  Oh, okay. That's what you meant... All right, thanks.[lr]::
6076::$$$message_0041_0059_0003$$$::   Yes. And add extra meat, please.[lr]::
6077::$$$message_0041_0059_0004$$$::   Roger that. I'll make the portion twenty percent bigger than usual.[rf][lr]::
6078::$$$message_0041_0059_0005$$$::Eye contact established. Transmission complete.::
6079::$$$message_0041_0060_0000$$$::"Okay. Come to my room, then."[lr]::
6080::$$$message_0041_0060_0001$$$::Tohsaka and Saber leave the kitchen together. I watch them go.[lr]::
6081::$$$message_0041_0060_0002$$$::"...You can come out now, Caster."::
6082::$$$message_0041_0061_0000$$$::"A garbage bag... I've been called a witch and a demoness before, but a garbage bag...?"[lr]::
6083::$$$message_0041_0061_0001$$$::I can hear her weeping.[lr]::
6084::$$$message_0041_0061_0002$$$::Hmm...[lr]::
6085::$$$message_0041_0061_0003$$$::I knew this house was enemy territory for Caster, but I didn't think she'd have this rough a time.[lr]::
6086::$$$message_0041_0061_0004$$$::Somehow, I sense our future lessons aren't going to be easy...::
905992::$$$message_9041_0030_0000$$$::"It seems you have quite a sophisticated palate, thanks to the boy."[r]::

